    "created_at": "2022-07-26T12:43:56Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-07-26T12:43:56Z",
    "body": "@domenic \r\nCould you explain when the preparation-time document check will fail for import-maps?\r\nAs the import map  doesn't support external, neither it supports 'async' nor 'defer',\r\nthe 'execute the script element' part should be run immediately after 'prepare the script element' for inline import maps, so the 'preparation-time document check' should always succeed.\r\nShould the 'register an import map' be done in 'prepare the script element' ?\r\n\r\n",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "reactions": {
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/whatwg/html/issues/comments/1195433750/reactions",
      "total_count": 0,
